# Keep the build context small and free of local state / secrets.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/generated
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/keys
**/*.pem
.git
docs
deploy/*.md
# master-data.sql holds real student and staff records. The seed does not read
# it; the deploy admin loads it into the database from the server's checkout
# with psql (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md). Keep it out of every image, and never push
# an image of this repository to a public registry.
backend/prisma/data/
